{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、みゆのお誕生日でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1KMAKHRMYWH13EDKBJQ9Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nおめでとう〜。\n撮影…なーこカメラマン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なお顔  ゜艸゜)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツーショット。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1KP476ZAEY8HJJ6ACCJ3T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンブランではなく〜、フルーツタルトです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゆは面白いです。いつも私のツボに入ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばかはかえりまーす と、みゆがけやかけで言ってから、〇〇まーすと、語尾にまーすをつけるのが、今はやっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい顔芸も楽しみだ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、よろしくね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の、私のお昼ご飯。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1KQFWCCMHMV5J8S6E5JGH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大戸屋の、鶏の黒酢あんかけ。\nこれに、かぼちゃコロッケをつけます。\nコロッケも大好き〜(∩´∀`∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定食にハマってるなーこです。定食って素敵。\n次は、星乃珈琲のオムライスが食べたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週食べたオムライスものっけときます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1KS8P4JQ07XGJTHAQCQB0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズインオムライスﾟ+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も作れるようになりたい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、オムくんの人形の頭のケチャップはななこの、NとAを表しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づきました?|´-`)ﾁﾗｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で見つけてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでキメてみました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1KTWEHNVAJDJD5QWEY84C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nあれ、しーちゃーーーん(･o･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◢長沢菜々香◢"}],"source":"archive"}